{"id":"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language.md","title":"Pohlers Infinitary Language","display":"df-pohlers-infinitary-language — Pohlers Infinitary Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language","aliases":["72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language"],"display":"df-pohlers-infinitary-language — Pohlers Infinitary Language","depends_on":["[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)","source_location":"§§8.1–8.3.1, print131–135/PDF141–145","verification_status":"source-and-signature-reviewed","proof_status":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"移除来源说明中的重复句"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pohlers-infinitary-language — Pohlers Infinitary Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§§8.1–8.3.1, print131–135/PDF141–145"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-signature-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"移除来源说明中的重复句"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>在ZFC元语言中工作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>为首个不可数序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>是可数集合变量集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PR}_k\">\\(\\mathsf{PR}_k\\)</span>为所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元本原递归函数的带固定解释函数的符号集，包含后继函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot0\">\\(\\dot0\\)</span>为数项常元。尖括号为带标签的语法树节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span>为集合函数的值域、定义域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fin}(A)=\\{B\\subseteq A:|B|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fin}(A)=\\{B\\subseteq A:|B|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>为标准有限子集记号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{T}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathsf L\\)</span>及阶段<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_\\eta\">\\(\\mathsf L_\\eta\\)</span>在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf T\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\eta&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(t)\\in\\omega\">\\(v(t)\\in\\omega\\)</span>为数项的递归求值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim\">\\(\\sim\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CS}\">\\(\\operatorname{CS}\\)</span>分别为自由集合变量集、秩、形式否定和特征序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D\">\\(\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D\\)</span>分别为合取型、析取型公式集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot n\">\\(\\dot n\\)</span>是由后继和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot0\">\\(\\dot0\\)</span>组成的数码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\land G,F\\lor G,F\\to G\">\\(F\\land G,F\\lor G,F\\to G\\)</span>是下式所定义的语法缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>允许元语言中的数值代入模板<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(A(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span>：在上述同一棵良基公式树的项叶中允许有限个数值孔<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec n)\">\\(A(\\vec n)\\)</span>表示将孔替换为数码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot n_i\">\\(\\dot n_i\\)</span>。模板的秩用同一递归式，项原子秩仍为0；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L^{(k)}\">\\(\\mathsf L^{(k)}\\)</span>表示所有这种有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>个孔、无自由集合变量的模板。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,j,n\\in\\omega\">\\(k,j,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>用于孔下标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\vec n}\">\\(\\sigma_{\\vec n}\\)</span>是下式的结构代入函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{succ}\\in\\mathsf{PR}_1\">\\(\\mathsf{succ}\\in\\mathsf{PR}_1\\)</span>解释为自然数后继。数值孔不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathsf L\\)</span>的对象变量，不在无穷演算中量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的函数符号使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a> 的程序标签：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf f_c\">\\(\\mathsf f_c\\)</span> 与数常元、集合变量、模板孔及逻辑标签不相交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 为 Assertion 给出的解释映射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 只在无模板孔的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T\">\\(\\mathsf T\\)</span> 上求值；含孔项先应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\vec n}\">\\(\\sigma_{\\vec n}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PR}_k:=\\{\\mathsf f_c:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\qquad\\mathcal I(\\mathsf f_c):=⟦ c⟧,\\qquad\\mathsf{succ}:=\\mathsf f_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PR}_k:=\\{\\mathsf f_c:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\qquad\\mathcal I(\\mathsf f_c):=⟦ c⟧,\\qquad\\mathsf{succ}:=\\mathsf f_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{0,k}:=\\{\\dot0\\}\\cup\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\\quad\\mathsf T_{n+1,k}:=\\mathsf T_{n,k}\\cup\\{\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle:j\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathsf{PR}_j\\land\\vec t\\in\\mathsf T_{n,k}^{j}\\},\\quad\\mathsf T_k:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf T_{n,k},\\quad\\mathsf T:=\\mathsf T_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{0,k}:=\\{\\dot0\\}\\cup\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\},\\quad\\mathsf T_{n+1,k}:=\\mathsf T_{n,k}\\cup\\{\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle:j\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathsf{PR}_j\\land\\vec t\\in\\mathsf T_{n,k}^{j}\\},\\quad\\mathsf T_k:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf T_{n,k},\\quad\\mathsf T:=\\mathsf T_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v(\\dot0)=0,\\quad v(\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle)=\\mathcal I(f)(\\langle v(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;j}),\\quad\\dot{(n+1)}:=\\langle\\mathsf{succ},\\langle\\dot n\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v(\\dot0)=0,\\quad v(\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle)=\\mathcal I(f)(\\langle v(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;j}),\\quad\\dot{(n+1)}:=\\langle\\mathsf{succ},\\langle\\dot n\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_{0,k}:=\\{\\langle q,s,t\\rangle:q\\in\\{=,\\ne\\},\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf T_k\\}\\cup\\{\\langle e,s,X\\rangle:e\\in\\{\\in,\\notin\\},\\ s\\in\\mathsf T_k,\\ X\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L_{0,k}:=\\{\\langle q,s,t\\rangle:q\\in\\{=,\\ne\\},\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf T_k\\}\\cup\\{\\langle e,s,X\\rangle:e\\in\\{\\in,\\notin\\},\\ s\\in\\mathsf T_k,\\ X\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_{\\eta+1,k}:=\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}\\cup\\{\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle:\\circ\\in\\{\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\},\\ \\operatorname{dom}(f)\\in\\omega_1,\\ \\operatorname{rng}(f)\\subseteq\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k},\\ \\bigcup_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(f(i))\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(V)\\},\\quad \\mathsf L_{\\lambda,k}:=\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\lambda}\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}\\ (0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1,\\ \\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Lim}),\\quad\\mathsf L_\\eta:=\\mathsf L_{\\eta,0},\\quad\\mathsf L:=\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathsf L_\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L_{\\eta+1,k}:=\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}\\cup\\{\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle:\\circ\\in\\{\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\},\\ \\operatorname{dom}(f)\\in\\omega_1,\\ \\operatorname{rng}(f)\\subseteq\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k},\\ \\bigcup_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(f(i))\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(V)\\},\\quad \\mathsf L_{\\lambda,k}:=\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\lambda}\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}\\ (0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1,\\ \\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Lim}),\\quad\\mathsf L_\\eta:=\\mathsf L_{\\eta,0},\\quad\\mathsf L:=\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathsf L_\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L^{(k)}:=\\{A\\in\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\dot0)=\\dot0,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(x_i)=\\dot n_i,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle)=\\langle f,\\langle\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t_i)\\rangle_i\\rangle,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L^{(k)}:=\\{A\\in\\bigcup_{\\eta&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathsf L_{\\eta,k}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\dot0)=\\dot0,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(x_i)=\\dot n_i,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle)=\\langle f,\\langle\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t_i)\\rangle_i\\rangle,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\langle q,\\sigma_{\\vec n}(s),\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t)\\rangle,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle e,t,X\\rangle)=\\langle e,\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t),X\\rangle,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\circ,\\langle\\sigma_{\\vec n}(f(i))\\rangle_i\\rangle,\\quad A(\\vec n):=\\sigma_{\\vec n}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\langle q,\\sigma_{\\vec n}(s),\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t)\\rangle,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle e,t,X\\rangle)=\\langle e,\\sigma_{\\vec n}(t),X\\rangle,\\quad\\sigma_{\\vec n}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\circ,\\langle\\sigma_{\\vec n}(f(i))\\rangle_i\\rangle,\\quad A(\\vec n):=\\sigma_{\\vec n}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle e,s,X\\rangle)=\\{X\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(f(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle e,s,X\\rangle)=\\{X\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(f(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle e,s,X\\rangle)=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\sup_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)}(\\operatorname{rk}(f(i))+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle)=\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle e,s,X\\rangle)=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{rk}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle)=\\sup_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)}(\\operatorname{rk}(f(i))+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sim\\langle=,s,t\\rangle=\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle=\\langle=,s,t\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle=\\langle\\notin,s,X\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\notin,s,X\\rangle=\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sim\\langle=,s,t\\rangle=\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle=\\langle=,s,t\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle=\\langle\\notin,s,X\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\notin,s,X\\rangle=\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sim\\langle\\bigwedge,f\\rangle=\\langle\\bigvee,\\langle\\sim f(i)\\rangle_i\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\bigvee,f\\rangle=\\langle\\bigwedge,\\langle\\sim f(i)\\rangle_i\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sim\\langle\\bigwedge,f\\rangle=\\langle\\bigvee,\\langle\\sim f(i)\\rangle_i\\rangle,\\quad\\sim\\langle\\bigvee,f\\rangle=\\langle\\bigwedge,\\langle\\sim f(i)\\rangle_i\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf W:=\\{\\langle=,s,t\\rangle:v(s)=v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle:v(s)\\ne v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\bigwedge,f\\rangle\\in\\mathsf L\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf W:=\\{\\langle=,s,t\\rangle:v(s)=v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle:v(s)\\ne v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\bigwedge,f\\rangle\\in\\mathsf L\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D:=\\{\\langle=,s,t\\rangle:v(s)\\ne v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle:v(s)=v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\bigvee,f\\rangle\\in\\mathsf L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D:=\\{\\langle=,s,t\\rangle:v(s)\\ne v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\ne,s,t\\rangle:v(s)=v(t)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\bigvee,f\\rangle\\in\\mathsf L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CS}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle):=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{CS}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle):=f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CS}(\\langle q,s,t\\rangle):=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{CS}(\\langle\\circ,f\\rangle):=f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F\\land G:=\\bigwedge\\langle F,G\\rangle,\\quad F\\lor G:=\\bigvee\\langle F,G\\rangle,\\quad F\\to G:=(\\sim F)\\lor G,\\quad\\bigwedge_{i&lt;\\lambda}F_i:=\\langle\\bigwedge,\\langle F_i\\rangle_{i&lt;\\lambda}\\rangle,\\quad\\bigvee_{i&lt;\\lambda}F_i:=\\langle\\bigvee,\\langle F_i\\rangle_{i&lt;\\lambda}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F\\land G:=\\bigwedge\\langle F,G\\rangle,\\quad F\\lor G:=\\bigvee\\langle F,G\\rangle,\\quad F\\to G:=(\\sim F)\\lor G,\\quad\\bigwedge_{i&lt;\\lambda}F_i:=\\langle\\bigwedge,\\langle F_i\\rangle_{i&lt;\\lambda}\\rangle,\\quad\\bigvee_{i&lt;\\lambda}F_i:=\\langle\\bigvee,\\langle F_i\\rangle_{i&lt;\\lambda}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限项闭包按ω阶段并构建，避免对所有集合构成的真类取未注明交集。逐条转写8.1.1，并显式给出集合大小的阶段构造和8.3.1的公式秩。每个公式是良基的可数分支树；ω1的正则性保证其秩可数，结构递归唯一。这里保留自由集合参数，并没有把任意无穷公式压缩成有限算术公式。数值孔仅使源书中“公式定义ω上的序”及数值代入可明确表示，是元语言模板，闭合实例才进入演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的函数符号使用 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]] 的程序标签：$\\mathsf f_c$ 与数常元、集合变量、模板孔及逻辑标签不相交。$\\mathcal I$ 为 Assertion 给出的解释映射，$v$ 只在无模板孔的 $\\mathsf T$ 上求值；含孔项先应用 $\\sigma_{\\vec n}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PR}_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rng}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fin}(A)=\\{B\\subseteq A:|B|<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"v(t)\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rk}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot n","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot0","display":false},{"tex":"F\\land G,F\\lor G,F\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"A(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\vec n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot n_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k,j,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{\\vec n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{succ}\\in\\mathsf{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf f_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{\\vec n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PR}_k:=\\{\\mathsf f_c:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=k\\},\\qquad\\mathcal I(\\mathsf f_c):=⟦ c⟧,\\qquad\\mathsf{succ}:=\\mathsf f_S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\maths